The '''Campaign Poster''' is a {{Special}} [[Memento]] that was available to players that tested the [[Changelog/2024/June 3|Better Mayors]] update on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Campaign Poster''' was only obtainable by completing a list of objectives given by {{NPCSprite|Centauri}} to test different aspects 
of the Better Mayors update.

Upon completion of all objectives, the following message was displayed:
{{Dialogue|
&f&l ALPHA TASK COMPLETE
&aCongratulations on completing all the objectives on the Alpha Checklist! Your commemorative item will be delivered to you shortly. Thanks for testing!
&7 Your reward: &cCampaign Poster
}}

The '''Campaign Poster''' was delivered to players' islands via {{NPCSprite|Jerry}}.

